{"symbol":"EARTH","yahoo":"EARTH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Earthstahl & Alloys Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Metal Fabrication","website":"https://www.earthstahl.com","about":"Earthstahl & Alloys Limited produces and sells cast iron lumps, ductile iron, cast iron, steels, alloys, and non-ferrous castings in India. The company operates in two segments, Submerged Arc Furnace and Foundry. The company offers grate bars, crusher hammers, foundry grade cast iron, sockets, tees, bends, spigots, tapers, grate bar castings, investment castings, pump cover castings, pump cover LFC molds, sinter bars, tractor castings, railway parts, engine blocks, industrial parts and equipment, and pulleys. The company was formerly known as Earthstahl & Alloys Private Limited. Earthstahl & Alloys Limited was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Raipur, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:19:47+00:00","quote":{"price":12.5,"prevClose":12.5,"marketCap":15.3,"high52":31.99,"low52":11.3,"pe":null,"bookValue":26.59,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-13.99,"shares":1.224,"insiders":76.98,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-02-08","2023-02-09","2023-02-10","2023-02-13","2023-02-14","2023-02-15","2023-02-16","2023-02-17","2023-02-20","2023-02-21","2023-02-22","2023-02-23","2023-02-24","2023-02-27","2023-02-28","2023-03-01","2023-03-02","2023-03-03","2023-03-06","2023-03-08","2023-03-09","2023-03-10","2023-03-13","2023-03-14","2023-03-15","2023-03-16","2023-03-17","2023-03-20","2023-03-21","2023-03-22","2023-03-23","2023-03-24","2023-03-27","2023-03-28","2023-03-29","2023-03-31","2023-04-03","2023-04-05","2023-04-06","2023-04-10","2023-04-11","2023-04-12","2023-04-13","2023-04-17","2023-04-18","2023-04-19","2023-04-20","2023-04-21","2023-04-24","2023-04-25","2023-04-26","2023-04-27","2023-04-28","2023-05-02","2023-05-03","2023-05-04","2023-05-05","2023-05-08","2023-05-09","2023-05-10","2023-05-11","2023-05-12","2023-05-15","2023-05-16","2023-05-17","2023-05-18","2023-05-19","2023-